			"locked": false,
			"text": "What are our acccess patterns ?\nhow will data grow ?\nwhat happends when a node fail ?\n\nFirst thing is Partioning and Sharding\nRange based Partioning \nDirectory base Partioning \nHashed based Partioning (Navie Modulo / consistent hashing )\n\n \n\n\n\n\n",
